    {
      "text": "Almighty God gave his Only Begotten Son, D&C 20:21 (49:5). redemption through faith on mine Only Begotten Son, D&C 29:42. little children are redeemed through mine Only Begotten, D&C 29:46. redemption only to those who receive mine Only Begotten Son, D&C 49:5. things ordained of the Father through his Only Begotten Son, D&C 76:13. voice bears record of the Only Begotten, D&C 76:23. Lucifer rebelled against the Only Begotten Son, D&C 76:25–26. sons of perdition deny the Only Begotten Son, D&C 76:35. priests after order of Melchizedek, which is order of the Only Begotten Son, D&C 76:57 (124:123). Christ’s glory is glory of the Only Begotten, D&C 93:11. Resurrection through grace of the Father and his Only Begotten Son, Jesus Christ, D&C 138:14. Redemption through sacrifice of the Only Begotten Son, D&C 138:57.",
